WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Why CaribBooks exists

00:01:07.000 --> 00:02:29.000
A transaction by text

00:02:29.000 --> 00:03:11.000
A receipt by photo

00:03:11.000 --> 00:04:45.000
A transaction by voice note

00:04:45.000 --> 00:06:34.000
Reminders, for the payment you have not made yet

00:06:34.000 --> 00:08:30.000
Reports, requested from the chat

00:08:30.000 --> 00:10:49.000
The reminder fires, and posts from the reply

00:10:49.000 --> 00:12:06.000
That is how CB works
